;; The practice room (hero training, docs/HEROES.md): one screen with a floor, a step up to a high
;; ledge, a brick row with a ? block, a target dummy, a gap (falling in puts the hero back at the
;; start) and a tall wall to cling to. src/game/tutorial/room.ts loads it with ?raw, so it is not in
;; the level library, the dev level select or the campaign. The room spawns the dummy itself.
id: practice
name: TRAINING
world: 1
stage: 1
theme: overworld
music: overworld
time: 400
start: 5,12
startMode: stand
camera: locked

